---
import ContentSection from "../components/content-section.astro";
---

<ContentSection
  eyebrow="The product"
  title="Implement Noble Ledger with confidence"
  id="implementation"
>
  <Fragment slot="lead">
    Noble Ledger was created to reduce the overhead of running a non-profit
    condominium corporation.
  </Fragment>
  <div class="shot-grid">
    <div class="shot-copy">
      <p>
        Onboarding starts from your prior auditor's closing statement: import
        opening balances, map your chart of accounts to your province's
        reporting requirements, and post your first entry the same afternoon.
      </p>
      <p>
        The dashboard keeps operating and reserve funds side by side, so the
        board always sees the same numbers the auditor will.
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="https://nobleledger.com">Get started</a>
    </div>
    <figure class="shot" style="margin:0">
      <div class="lh"><span>Noble Ledger · dashboard</span></div>
      <img
        src="https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/condo-mgmt.appspot.com/o/dashboard.jpg?alt=media&token=6264e567-eec3-487b-a402-e44a2d0abae9"
        alt="Noble Ledger dashboard screenshot"
        width="2432"
        height="1442"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </figure>
  </div>
</ContentSection>
